    "UIName": "Ballista 'Hellstorm'",
    "Id": "vehicledef_BALLISTA_Hellstorm",
    "Name": "Ballista 'Hellstorm'",
    "Details": "Designed solely as an artillery vehicle, the Ballista mounts a Sniper Artillery piece in the turret; supplied with 3 tons of ammo. The Ballista's secondary weaponry consists of three Machine Guns, two mounted forward and one in the rear of the tank. Powered by a 165-rated Internal Combustion Engine, the vehicle is able to keep up at modest pace with other mobile support elements. Protecting the Ballista's hull is 7.5 tons of armor, giving adequate protection against enemy fire should opposing forces manage to penetrate deeply behind friendly battle lines.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       160     30\n<b>Left</b>         125     30\n<b>Right</b>       125     30\n<b>Rear</b>        100     30\n<b>Turret</b>      125     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      635    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color>",
    "Icon": "Ballista"
  },
